<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Seed label templates for the first batch of label-center models
    (design decision 8). noupdate="1" so on-site layout tweaks made in
    the designer survive module upgrades.

    All templates are global (company_id empty) and target 560x320 dots
    (70x40 mm at 203 dpi). Fixed texts are English record values; they
    can be reworded per site in the designer.
-->
